## 3. Media Buying Strategy

### 3.1 Target Audience Analysis

Our target audience consists of tech-savvy millennials who value innovative solutions. The demographic breakdown is as follows:

| Demographic    | Percentage (%) | Estimated Reach |
|----------------|----------------|------------------|
| Age 25-30      | 45%            | 150,000          |
| Age 31-35      | 55%            | 180,000          |
| Total Reach     | 100%           | 330,000          |

### 3.2 Media Channels Selection

We will utilize a multi-channel approach for media buying, focusing on:

| Media Channel        | Budget Allocation (%) | Estimated Impressions | Target Audience Reach |
|----------------------|----------------------|-----------------------|-----------------------|
| Social Media (Facebook, Instagram) | 40%                  | 1,200,000             | 250,000               |
