## 4. Targeting

### 4.1 Audience Segmentation

We will segment our audience based on the following criteria:

| Segment           | Description                       | Size (Estimated) |
|-------------------|-----------------------------------|-------------------|
| Tech Startups     | Founders and employees of startups | 100,000           |
| Corporates        | Employees in larger tech firms     | 150,000           |
| Freelancers       | Independent contractors in tech    | 80,000            |

### 4.2 Behavioral Targeting

The campaign will utilize advanced behavioral targeting techniques to reach users based on their online activities:

- **Retargeting Campaigns:** Target previous visitors to our website.
- **Lookalike Audiences:** Create audiences similar to our best customers using Facebook Ads Manager.

